speechtext:
He will be assisted by an executive advisory group consisting of: Richard Cashin, President of the Fishermen's Food and Allied Workers' Union in Newfoundland; Carol Corcoran, a barrister and solicitor and acting band manager of the Fort Nelson Indian Band and a former chief of the band; Fil Fraser, Chief Commissioner of the Alberta Human Rights Foundation; Thomas Kierans, President of the C. D. Howe Institute;

Robert Normand, a former Deputy Minister of Finance in the Quebec government, chairman and editor of Le Soleil.

Helena Zukowski, screenwriter and author; [Translation]
Therese Paquet-Sevigny, Under-Secretary General of the United Nations; Roger Tasse, a former Deputy Minister of Justice, and Executive Vice-President of Bell Canada;

Susan Van de Velde, farmer and community activist; Elsie Wayne, mayor of Saint John, New Brunswick; and Jack Webster, broadcaster, journalist and author.
